Package: iob-zip
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gnome | xdg-desktop-portal-kde | xdg-desktop-portal-backend, libdbus-1-3
Suggests: file-roller
Description: Native 7-Zip-style archiver for Linux
 A two-pane archive manager written in pure Rust: browse your files on the
 left, browse or create archives on the right.
 .
 Features:
  * Read and write 7z, zip, tar, tar.gz, tar.xz, tar.bz2 and tar.zst
  * Read RAR archives natively (no unrar binary needed)
  * Browse archive contents in-app, preview small text files
  * Open PDFs, media, images and office documents with the system default app
  * Extract everything, or just the selected item
  * Test archives for integrity, inspect properties
  * No Wine, no Qt, no external 7z process
